data: {"delta":{"text":"Dispatch d002 is complete and closed.\n\nSummary:\n- Created `src/greet.py` (`greet(name)` → `\"Hello, \u003cname\u003e!\"`) and `tests/test_greet.py` (tests for a normal name and the empty string).\n- Also added an empty `src/__init__.py` so `src` is importable from the tests — the one file outside the two named in the dispatch, disclosed as required.\n- Ran `python3 -m unittest discover -s tests` from the repo root: 2 tests passed, exit code 0.\n- Committed to branch `cs-sandbox/<DEV:1>.<GROUP:1>` (commit `4bda13b`).\n- Wrote the full summary to `~/.local/share/cs-campaign/output/d002-summary.md` and closed the dispatch via `cs-campaign-member reply`.","type":"text_delta"},"index":0,"type":"content_block_delta"}

